    <us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementBenefitsDisclosureTextBlock contextRef="c-1" id="f-1228">Retirement Benefit Plans&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company provides retirement benefit plans in the United States and certain foreign countries. The Company has a 401(k) retirement plan that allows participating employees in the United States to contribute as defined by the plan and subject to Internal Revenue Service limitations. The Company matches 75% of employees&#x2019; contributions up to 6% of their eligible compensation. The Company&#x2019;s contributions to the 401(k) plan for 2025, 2024 and 2023 were approximately $84 million, $78 million and $70 million, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementBenefitsDisclosureTextBlock>
